flowchart LR
  Sources["Registered public court PDFs and SEC HTML"] --> Extract["Azure Document Intelligence or native SEC parser"]
  Extract --> Records["Versioned document records"]
  Records --> Chunks["Structure-aware public chunks"]
  Chunks --> Search["Azure AI Search promoted index"]
  Search --> Answer["Azure OpenAI grounded answer service"]
  Answer --> App["Read-only Flask evidence workspace"]
  App --> Citations["Canonical source, section, page, and checksum"]
  Evaluation["Versioned release evaluation"] --> Search
  Identity["Managed identity and Azure resource boundary"] --> Search
  Identity --> Answer
